msgid "⟪k:0⟫Ah..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ah..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_CDA793AA_8C43_4FEC_9F5D_017005C93182
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3691478de9533325d7652ee41b237ff6e6949bcec1ceb3b83014bb1b6da2de8b
#. default-sha256: 7bbba58e8c2e182a8eddbd8e39c5a8a02f0014a11e3d9d263aec6dc764165435
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CDA793AA_8C43_4FEC_9F5D_017005C93182"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There’s... ⟪k:1⟫no reason you have to leave town.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫My old man says the Campanellas "
"have more power."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Vous êtes pas... ⟪k:1⟫obligés de quitter la ville.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Mon vieux dit que les "
"Campanellas ont plus de pouvoir."

#: scenario3:scenario3_16A96EA9_EC19_443A_9899_DD960278A6BB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 15186f717982f4995aa775193e364a03bd0ae6e8b37d8aae1e99ebb1b0150fcf
#. default-sha256: 22aa5ab134c7fa46696a7cf1f07de3a2b56c85d0b00a8884ecec88bbb4a4eaf1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_16A96EA9_EC19_443A_9899_DD960278A6BB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I should be the one leaving."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫C’est moi qui devrais partir."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4A434A8E_FC21_45BB_B783_9126F1B071DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 607ab1bf0375105e7063008fcc9cbb9f6b2f9d09ff203edd58e7dd234ce3d5b6
#. default-sha256: d5b6e4d8107cf456e443ce7fd3a22d55176d4d458be1af0d263dea4f869e84cd
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4A434A8E_FC21_45BB_B783_9126F1B071DF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It’s not that simple.⟪k:1⟫Grownups have a lot to consider.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫So don’t give me that "
"look, Jacopo."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’est pas si simple.⟪k:1⟫Les adultes doivent penser à plein de choses.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Alors, me "
"regarde pas comme ça, Jacopo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_ED963991_E6FC_4B9D_8FD8_2632C7573FA6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb6ca7e97341bb7f2c4bf95fedd23c58618283e3198e3c3e2a1479234ab666a9
#. default-sha256: 48f41697b22461c825c2f67ac00db3078091b23a05c42741f58ec0ffc02c435d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_ED963991_E6FC_4B9D_8FD8_2632C7573FA6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario3:scenario3_94BEA963_2835_4F52_912F_6D6743EBAE65
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c803d3a69690e7691e0c058e9f9447d7eed8a3bf7fec504833473c186d488a63
#. default-sha256: caa36f105a3123532743b907eec302a662104cf24cebc3dfc76eb96060581526
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_94BEA963_2835_4F52_912F_6D6743EBAE65"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We were kids, but we’d both kinda started to catch on—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫to the situation with our "
"families, and to the bonds that land held on us."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫On n’était que des enfants mais on commençait à comprendre ce qui se passait—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ la "
"situation dans laquelle vivaient nos familles et les liens que ce pays nous imposait."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B0E1009B_E596_43B6_8C25_F53242CA2929
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb6eee8bf103d2464873c102f36cd94a41e3fb7b3729afe1b704a5dceef045b8
#. default-sha256: 5a4ff9efdfaf9f6bb92fb63060d0c9413f71b84c74ba7e7adc286bdeabc08713
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B0E1009B_E596_43B6_8C25_F53242CA2929"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Although we didn’t know any of the details at the time."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mais on ne connaissait pas tous les détails à l’époque."

#: scenario3:scenario3_420E9C01_B49E_4D3D_9484_B9EB1E8426BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7ec62a9a42604ab1cfb2890ef5f05ed7adcb3c847dca63e5bd17eb84a5b6f4fe
#. default-sha256: 9f5eb68561bf72411b7bdf5cd309176ecdaf1dd0867d827beede2f4ca6e9a0f6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_420E9C01_B49E_4D3D_9484_B9EB1E8426BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My grandpa owned all the land the city was built on, but he was a very conservative man. "
"⟪k:1⟫He didn’t try to spread his influence, instead opting to fortify what he already had."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mon grand-père possédait toutes les terres de la ville mais c’était un homme très "
"conservateur. ⟪k:1⟫Il n’essayait pas d’accroître son influence, il préférait consolider ce qu’il "
"avait déjà."

#: scenario3:scenario3_44E5E60F_619F_4783_9AF8_6D59FB70B4CA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d44c5b607f5151194a29df2046bbf033d8fd0e68e3adf677a7debcffc5df321e
#. default-sha256: 021bcb8524269db30f94ab850f59fa1d99fb2b6a24829658e38d06641594a91c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_44E5E60F_619F_4783_9AF8_6D59FB70B4CA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I don’t know exactly when it first started, but organizations were used to administrate "
"cities."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je ne sais pas exactement quand ça a commencé mais les organisations servaient au début à "
"administrer les villes."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FE03D2C2_CE9D_49A0_AD09_93D508BD862D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 51ed5b0aa1be8e9f8caa05b543cf8a139db5d681643e17de70e01b8d7582f708
#. default-sha256: 8fae39dcf8c6189d948618ab0bafb172fc7b443f5b4ffa1fae9424d7773a6b2d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FE03D2C2_CE9D_49A0_AD09_93D508BD862D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And when we were kids, my dad was the capofamiglia, and my grandpa his consigliere."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et quand on était petit, mon père était le capofamiglia, le parrain et mon grand-père son "
"consigliere."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DE4155A7_D75E_47AA_BA2F_C5237A5D2575
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea1f32b370c68a0faf90d970d00e9d62faf3e98185dbe5eecc8c149e74ef374e
#. default-sha256: 4bda6529fae7133e5b44b65b7452fbc864c0fbf648f5b7cb25a0c4960d2e589a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DE4155A7_D75E_47AA_BA2F_C5237A5D2575"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But just because he was an adviser didn’t mean he was powerless. ⟪k:1⟫While my dad made the "
"decisions, my grandpa was the only one allowed to fight him on them."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Le fait qu’il ne soit que conseiller ne signifiait pas qu’il n’avait pas de pouvoir. ⟪k:1⟫Si "
"c’était mon père qui prenait les décisions, en revanche mon grand-père était le seul autorisé à "
"exprimer son désaccord."

#: scenario3:scenario3_56045517_5319_4499_BB6B_D42414E734FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c8a6c5e3863a4c75b030246f2b9f3f69ce80bc81365e8990410d6917a2ac8ddd
#. default-sha256: 972570426fc26ae58280aa021f8b243aeb699f896a3fc38d954a5117e11bee59
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_56045517_5319_4499_BB6B_D42414E734FE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Your father was a capodecina that served under my dad; ⟪k:1⟫he wasn’t especially happy about "
"that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ton père était un capodecina aux ordres du mien, ⟪k:1⟫ce qui ne lui plaisait pas tellement."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E92A8C87_218D_41CE_9786_583BDA361FB7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 39e6c487187f135dbdc4976f4ac835dadc937212efe23895389d6f364c0614ed
#. default-sha256: 3385906f73db02e729e24eed865f57b464ecc0c5c5a97ce258e52bf5219b8998
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E92A8C87_218D_41CE_9786_583BDA361FB7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But parents’ quarreling doesn’t affect their kids—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫or at least, that’s what I "
"thought at the time, and what you probably thought too."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais les querelles des parents n’affectent pas leurs enfants—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ ou du moins c’est ce "
"que je pensais à l’époque, et ce que tu pensais probablement aussi."

#: scenario3:scenario3_28B62F9C_A22F_4061_8C74_AF06E01EF4AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b1c5d58059c06a3300a6b787c0d42a310abc7d267fbc65b07e1c6dde6a415c56
#. default-sha256: 08ada66c2e0204d57c7f58f367f8d98b2a74aa7ea3f14d913d57cc35b1f1a644
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_28B62F9C_A22F_4061_8C74_AF06E01EF4AE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But there was still a chance we could be caught in the crossfire, so my dad decided to send "
"me and my mom away."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais il y avait toujours une chance pour qu’on soit pris entre deux feux, c’est pourquoi mon "
"père avait décidé de nous éloigner, ma mère et moi."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F203B666_9A02_4FA1_97BC_4021E9442EBC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 05ff721d14b5d00195cca479c6657c008ca89c5301985e181135a81df9ec2309
#. default-sha256: 85194ad6c92e8a6f5c6e11e77b33bcd66ac25521e9a2061c0ae231fe86fec627
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F203B666_9A02_4FA1_97BC_4021E9442EBC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Off the island and to the north were some more prosperous areas."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Loin de l’île, au nord du pays, là où il y avait des régions plus prospères."

#: scenario3:scenario3_EFB90E92_858C_4A69_8A70_A1F053E3BA3A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d9aeba1c65e64ad1d5c86ec073863c3ff4ba9fbe4ac9cfd4aecb604889ee42b7
#. default-sha256: 628c50cdd86baab834d369f1f08d7517f303f6d0f0980154ba258c9026da2b3d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EFB90E92_858C_4A69_8A70_A1F053E3BA3A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He thought that by sending us there, we could live our lives clean, regardless of where we "
"came from."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il pensait qu’en nous envoyant là-bas nous pourrions repartir de zéro, sans le poids de nos "
"origines."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FB5A0103_4072_4CE8_97DE_29C346E2241A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad78b55bf76c2ec49fbd44695336df47e56422e25a8f2242aad96bd716551542
#. default-sha256: 019db791e6ee8420218771c4cb033d5751fb9fc92cc0b48cfe55b4c346fd8341
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FB5A0103_4072_4CE8_97DE_29C346E2241A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫There’s no changing what’s in your blood, though."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mais un tigre ne change pas ses rayures, et le sang reste le même."

#: scenario3:scenario3_65B10959_E51A_4BFE_BAD9_71004141E3EF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d0ae0e55f1b7db3e1a2c9bafc7284a2b2dbcf60f9c624aded27c561efa4c79e1
#. default-sha256: e2426916b5baf0327089c63bb350085565d7106f3478f603fcf918352bd11b3e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_65B10959_E51A_4BFE_BAD9_71004141E3EF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You could have told me too.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Or were you planning on leaving without saying anything?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Toi aussi, tu aurais pu me prévenir.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ou alors tu comptais partir sans rien me dire ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_238D2C70_8B02_445E_A29F_79A27DE018DE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2d60485a91bd58db804e92499131424570588a8bfce8efab744c43c1470e2065
#. default-sha256: 26f6ddde88cae37805574d9d1b7b625090c2e571f4cae02344e11ba104661ed1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_238D2C70_8B02_445E_A29F_79A27DE018DE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫No, it was just... ⟪k:1⟫all decided so quickly."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non, c’est juste que... ⟪k:1⟫tout s’est fait si vite."

#: scenario3:scenario3_526F465D_F414_4B7B_BDFB_CBB6009BBC02
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e53836ea6957f1593b949799d081a2ffb1655437a98e7843bf2e1daa95c8350
#. default-sha256: a8239fc7f4e5ca48fcece47cd93949130032a5991ef01d329fe2c88a1be59fcf
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_526F465D_F414_4B7B_BDFB_CBB6009BBC02"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why do you sound so accepting?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Et pourquoi t’as l’air d’être d’accord avec tout ça ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_E46D378D_F8E2_4F01_9878_B209DD6FB66B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c2591405d69812fdbed1943fc75065deb61af43ea556df718bd1b128ea30cfc0
#. default-sha256: d7cc9d58b7ba47fa5c2fceb27bac275e581929b82e16f4154271d8794f1f27c7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E46D378D_F8E2_4F01_9878_B209DD6FB66B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Adults have a lot to consider?⟪k:1⟫You bet they do! But you could at least let them know "
"you’re opposed to it, Maria! But no, your tail went straight between your legs as soon as you "
"were told."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Les adultes doivent penser à plein de choses ?⟪k:1⟫Ben oui, mais c’est pas une raison ! Tu "
"aurais pu au moins leur dire que t’étais pas d’accord, Maria ! Mais non, tu courbes l’échine, "
"sans rien dire."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DD4238B2_DF1E_4F6E_8239_B8DCDE698AFF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3606f695fc242d79bb19c99dee0070b4b16dba695ef458e1fe564151c55d5dc2
#. default-sha256: 8a352f61336ee32e1460b5baca7d03e044c610201855222daf4bf6416420e67e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DD4238B2_DF1E_4F6E_8239_B8DCDE698AFF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You just gave up and accepted it straight away!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tu renonces et t’acceptes directement !"

#: scenario3:scenario3_6ACE91E0_57E9_42AB_A176_501F27BA5E25
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f7fc024cc3c699406ee2f5e1c9aef1e01a669f170e381973ac33997c5ab475d1
#. default-sha256: 48f41697b22461c825c2f67ac00db3078091b23a05c42741f58ec0ffc02c435d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6ACE91E0_57E9_42AB_A176_501F27BA5E25"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario3:scenario3_AA349960_186A_4D99_B875_EEA811D839DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 232c489dd507818f2782b025e0f76a8c36fdd03b349136302122af0df51e3b4c
#. default-sha256: a86d1f1cb135dcccea92468112b4132f95cd2b7c9b5dc7e45c14060bdcd4d6f8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AA349960_186A_4D99_B875_EEA811D839DC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I thought you were better than that!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je pensais que tu valais mieux que ça !"

#: scenario3:scenario3_7B3F28C3_B933_491E_877B_A211002E3283
