msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CCB1C88A_AC58_4BE9_A9D6_52917DB50F78"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫In retrospect, I’m sure they knew where we were going, and just let us do our thing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Rétrospectivement, je suis sûre qu’ils savaient où on était et qu’ils nous laissaient faire."

#: scenario3:scenario3_98FB91E2_F439_41A4_B8A7_8B97EB96BFE6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 873da4a69887f29f7542be8c1072cea432eb1a78e5f8c505a61adc8c4e6d05a1
#. default-sha256: b7ad7c8d361576375bbebb788a5b4686bc8959fb5e63809960e832efb0a3c52a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_98FB91E2_F439_41A4_B8A7_8B97EB96BFE6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oh yeah, there was this one time we were playing and a huge storm rolled in, trapping us up "
"there."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ah, et il y a eu cette fois où on était en train de jouer et une énorme tempête nous avait "
"piégés à l’intérieur."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A08454AA_660C_4D48_896F_E734565DB339
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: deed54d65cdf715ac3cd70abd90243b07cf3d8071493fc49794e6fbb9658ff74
#. default-sha256: 8a070d173d296addb8249998110844fa7a77f44972483abb9d0b13193f675553
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A08454AA_660C_4D48_896F_E734565DB339"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The wind wasn’t just howling—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫it was screaming bloody murder."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Le vent ne faisait pas que souffler—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ il hurlait, il poussait des cris abominables."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E07DA6DF_8CAA_4E0E_8AC4_ED032E67AC78
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cc10313034627d335dd3f736cfdb3fbfc98122e5ca5f6afebafd071319fd064b
#. default-sha256: a73ea80cee7603183f251b8333bd1bf5e5986ac3bbd75568ef69725e6908ad97
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E07DA6DF_8CAA_4E0E_8AC4_ED032E67AC78"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was blowing so hard I thought the house might fly away.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫As I recall, you were "
"crying that night."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il ventait tellement que j’étais persuadée que la maison allait s’envoler.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Je me "
"souviens que tu avais pleuré cette nuit-là."

#: scenario3:scenario3_CE4A3EE0_25B3_4F1F_8B23_A9526C4A583C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 27902604bfede12a7daf4b64ab2887a50c4305a738ce6c471a7bed8baf42e01e
#. default-sha256: 181c6f8767c615e4ba45ceda568e18931fc669bfb9cc5a2d99f44282de9dbdf7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CE4A3EE0_25B3_4F1F_8B23_A9526C4A583C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hey, Nero! You here to see me off too?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hé, Nero ! T’es venu me dire au revoir, toi aussi ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_86BCCEFB_2D58_44BF_B3F9_DFF7B355BFA9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3ac908fd54e120bff617ead437c0e23c654bb27cf69bed4230d1b09ab8f5d071
