msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Aaaah, there you go wagging your tail with that dumb look on your face. ⟪k:2⟫You have "
"no idea what’s going on, do you?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Aaaah, te voilà, à remuer la queue avec ton regard stupide. ⟪k:2⟫Tu comprends rien à ce "
"qui se passe, hein ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_7E6688E5_CE53_43F7_9254_18DD8DC8ED88
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 23cf68e40165e97b907f196908da7a9e29bc72713f5f68309cfa7127af2933f4
#. default-sha256: 08e5ebce02ed3ced2bc36be107bbba4de3decd36ed0f3bc1a6ffe1a37284b951
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7E6688E5_CE53_43F7_9254_18DD8DC8ED88"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It wasn’t just the two of us who had made Casa Nostra our home base, though. ⟪k:1⟫There was "
"one more—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫a stray, black dog."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nous n’étions pas les seuls à avoir fait de Casa Nostra notre camp de base. ⟪k:1⟫Il y avait "
"aussi quelqu’un d’autre—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ un chien errant tout noir."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C60A5C6E_4397_4583_8C53_FDF14A32F11D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8e72556b81c5bdb4196e2315ea2f943bdfb41151016cc1029588de1bc7185a54
#. default-sha256: 36dc69736206d4e635f5710c1ffd4ea32e48d4002b821ffcfb54baa8e8b71d9c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C60A5C6E_4397_4583_8C53_FDF14A32F11D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’m pretty sure it didn’t have actually black fur, though, and it was just really, really "
"dirty."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je suis quasiment sûre qu’il n’avait pas vraiment le poil noir, en fait, mais qu’il était "
"juste très, très sale."

#: scenario3:scenario3_059B0B2F_D311_4652_A270_0198AD051606
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
