msgid "⟪k:0⟫Of course he doesn’t.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He’s a stupid animal."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Bien sûr que non.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ce n’est qu’un stupide animal."

#: scenario3:scenario3_36970D02_8361_4FF3_BD00_DA24A2B438B4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
