msgid "⟪k:0⟫Besides, you’re here, so it’ll be fine!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You take care of Nero, all right?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫En plus, tu restes, toi, alors c’est bon !⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Tu prendras soin de Nero, d’accord ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_0F4F8B09_6C5A_490B_9EF3_FFFD04D7C347
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
