msgid "⟪k:0⟫He doesn’t like me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You’re the only one who ⟪k:3⟫can⟪k:4⟫ take care of him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Il ne m’aime pas.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Tu es la seule à ⟪k:3⟫pouvoir⟪k:4⟫ t’occuper de lui."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C5DF990B_B101_4DA6_89BE_EC5024BB7C54
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
