msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tu ne reviendras jamais dans cette ville ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C6AB9DBD_DA31_4922_B89D_C3B382A55377
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d2387238a30f25e66ec3e9e8e9f4ff671f58783718bb7d2c7c9a2598bc79d4b5
